PART 3  THE ENVIRONMENTAL TEST -- absence in the never-froze class (G213)
==========================================================================================================

--- 3.1  the freeze ladder:  z* + 1 = m sigma^2/(k_B T_0) ------------
  freeze floor: sigma_min = 65.0 km/s @ 5 keV (z* = 0);  T_CMB(0) = 2.72548 K
