    group 250 -> z* = 13.8 (EoR);  cluster 600-992 -> z* = 84-232 (the dark ages)
    -> the equilibrium DECOUPLED: the 5.09-keV phase mass IS defined -> the 2.55-keV line is PRESENT (conditional on the decay existing)
  NEVER-FROZE class (z* < 0):  the dSph/UFD class, sigma_obs 2.3-11.7 km/s << 65 km/s:
    z*(pred) in [-0.9997, -0.9251], z*(obs) in [-0.9987, -0.9676] @ 5 keV (34 objects, G213 C4)
    T_b = 3.4 mK - 0.088 K < T_CMB(0): NO decoupling epoch exists -- the phantom NEVER FROZE, it is STILL EQUILIBRATING
    -> the 5.09-keV phase mass is UNDEFINED there -> NO 2.55-keV line

